window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Detective Darby Adler is about to hand in her badge.</b></p> <p>After inadvertently taking the mantle of Warden of Knoxville, Darby has painted a huge target on her back. With bridges burned and the ABI on her tail, she’ll have to decide between staying a small-town detective or leaning into her new role. </p> <p>It’s not only her job on the line - it’s her life.</p> <p>Who says small towns are boring?</p>"; 
